### 【前置说明】后端运行在 localhost:8080，session cookie IDE HTTP Client自动保存
### 1 获取CSRF令牌，拿到XSRF‑TOKEN Cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("xsrfToken", response.cookies.get("XSRF‑TOKEN").value);
%}

### 2 用户注册普通学生账号
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content‑Type: application/json
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "Abc123456",
  "displayName": "测试学生小明"
}

### 3 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content‑Type: application/json
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "Abc123456"
}

### 4 获取当前登录用户信息 me
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5 获取全部课程列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6 获取我的课程列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/mine
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7 加入课程，替换{courseId}为实际课程id
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/{{courseId}}/join
Content‑Type: application/json
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

{}

### 8 登出账号
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
X‑XSRF‑TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Accept: application/json
